        "https://tibia.fandom.com/index.php?curid=30848&oldid=1114684",
        "https://tibia.fandom.com/index.php?curid=31073&oldid=1050120 Mission One: Iriana quest, yes; Jimmy Iriana, yes. Mission Two: pick on the sewer dirt, rope up, use the crate; Jimmy quest gives Iriana's Chest; Iriana quest gives 10 Heaven Blossom.",
        "Native map: Iriana at 32849,31300,7 (Canary/Crystal agree); sealed plain door 5289 at 32858,31374,6 has no action id, so Jimmy's room is open; Jimmy at the wiki cell 32857,31383,6 on the passage stub restored by the qh_jimmy_stub world overlay (owner evidence 2026-11-17); dirt 8504 at 32803,31259,8 over tunnel 32803,31259,9; rope spot 386 at 32810,31253,9; crate 8771 at 32807,31252,8.",
        "Recipe adaptation: forgiving roof route without wrong-bridge resets or the assassin summon (server lane); the yes confirmations are folded into the keyword step."
      ],
