              "take": [],
              "give": null,
              "outfit": null,
              "achievement": null,
              "reply": [
                "<sighs> I had no other choice. I already have a bad conscience about this. You must know I only do this as I don't see any other options for me and my people to survive.",
                "Hey! I've got an idea. If you help me gather some food, you get... err... a part of Iriana's gold back.",
                "Do you know the tavern near the harbour? Its owner surely has some really delicious things in his cellar. Get me a crate of food out of his stock and bring it to me. Ask me about the quest when you have it."
              ],
              "sources": [
